    {
      "id": "Kv1_u_DLu5otrMRi2znqt",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 5870.5331504086425,
      "y": -1055.2430216445682,
      "width": 680.2395629882812,
      "height": 975,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b1G",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1627207374,
      "version": 1040,
      "versionNonce": 1046766478,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1792246276058,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Route\n    new Elysia()\n        .get('/', 'hello')\n        .get('/hi', 'hi')\n        .listen(3000)\n    paths can be grouped into 3 types\n        static paths\n            .get('/id/1', 'static path')\n        dynamic paths\n            .get('/id/:id', 'dynamic path')\n        wildcards\n            .get('/id/*', 'wildcard path')\n        \n    We can also make path parameters optional\n        optional_path_parameter\n            .get('/id/:id?')\n    Path Priority\n        1. Static paths\n        2. dynamic paths\n        3. wildcards\n    HTTP Verbs\n        GET\n            .get('/', 'hello')\n        POST\n            .post('/hi', 'hi')\n        PUT\n        PATCH\n        DELETE\n    HTTP Methods\n        accepts(path, function(to respond), hook(additional metadata)\n        custom HTTP Methods\n            .route('M-SEARCH', '/m-search', 'connect')\n        .all('/','hi')\n            all HTTP methods that match that route will be accepted\n    \nHandler\n    context(body, query, params, headers, cookie, store)\nPlugin\n",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Route\n    new Elysia()\n        .get('/', 'hello')\n        .get('/hi', 'hi')\n        .listen(3000)\n    paths can be grouped into 3 types\n        static paths\n            .get('/id/1', 'static path')\n        dynamic paths\n            .get('/id/:id', 'dynamic path')\n        wildcards\n            .get('/id/*', 'wildcard path')\n        \n    We can also make path parameters optional\n        optional_path_parameter\n            .get('/id/:id?')\n    Path Priority\n        1. Static paths\n        2. dynamic paths\n        3. wildcards\n    HTTP Verbs\n        GET\n            .get('/', 'hello')\n        POST\n            .post('/hi', 'hi')\n        PUT\n        PATCH\n        DELETE\n    HTTP Methods\n        accepts(path, function(to respond), hook(additional metadata)\n        custom HTTP Methods\n            .route('M-SEARCH', '/m-search', 'connect')\n        .all('/','hi')\n            all HTTP methods that match that route will be accepted\n    \nHandler\n    context(body, query, params, headers, cookie, store)\nPlugin\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
